OL,3,GNEWSAAttractions still open despite
OL,4,Abluetongue outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo far this year there have been 556
OL,7,Frecorded cases of the bluetongue virus
OL,8,F(BTV) in the UK including 327 in Devon
OL,9,Fand 110 in Cornwall, according to
OL,10,Flatest government figures.
